/*
   ============================================================
   VAULT OS 0.7
   ESP32-C3 + OLED 128x64 + 4 buttons
   ============================================================

   BUTTONS
   R5 = LEFT  / CHARSET-
   R6 = RIGHT / CHARSET+
   R7 = ENTER / ACCEPT
   R8 = BACK  / DELETE

   PINS
   SDA = GPIO 8
   SCL = GPIO 9
   R5  = GPIO 3
   R6  = GPIO 4
   R7  = GPIO 5
   R8  = GPIO 6

   ============================================================
   CHANGES v0.7
   ============================================================

   FIXED
   - web lock no longer freezes WebServer
   - loopTask stack raised to 16K (was causing reboot
     after web unlock due to PBKDF2 + WebServer)
   - device master-password entry now supports
     cursor left/right, not only append/backspace
   - settings / change-master / search / generator
     rewritten and actually reachable
   - all temp Strings removed from 20ms draw loop
   - MAX_RECORDS lowered to 16 to reduce heap pressure

   DEVICE KEYBOARD
   R5 short  = prev char
   R5 long   = prev charset
   R6 short  = next char
   R6 long   = next charset
   R7 short  = insert char
   R7 long   = accept / next field
   R8 short  = delete char (backspace at cursor)
   R8 long   = cancel

   SECURITY (unchanged from v0.6)
   - AES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 Encrypt-then-MAC
   - PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 -> 64 bytes
   - MAC verified BEFORE decrypting
   - random salt in header, random IV per save
   - atomic writes via .tmp + rename
   - failed password backoff
   - session cookie + CSRF
   - HTML escaping
   - random AP password
   - sensitive RAM wiped where practical
*/

